    "mathformer.native_boundary": {
      "execution": "Shared source functions back both main(argv) and typed MCP tools. MCP preparation applies hub preflight and every step applies mutation authorization, declared write containment and service mount checks. The CLI hub continues to own dry-run, enclosing subprocess capture/timeout and snapshot write auditing; those are outside the expanded main graph.",
