      "control": "Controller first completes complete/not_required maps without outstanding nodes; otherwise blocks nonexhaustive maps, repeated signatures, or iteration >= max_iterations, then completes if no nodes remain, else recommends recurse. A blocked map overrides any decision. This caller supplies no previous maps, so repeated-signature history is empty.",
